<h2>Get Involved</h2>

<p>There are many ways to support safer streets on Sand Point Way NE:</p>

<h2>Sign the Petition</h2>
<p>
  Add your name to our petition calling on the Seattle City Council and SDOT to
  prioritise pedestrian and cyclist safety improvements on Sand Point Way NE.
</p>

<h2>Attend Community Meetings</h2>
<p>
  We hold regular community meetings to discuss progress, share updates, and
  coordinate advocacy efforts.  Check back here for upcoming meeting dates.
</p>

<h2>Contact Your Council Member</h2>
<p>
  Reach out to your Seattle City Council member and let them know that safe
  streets on Sand Point Way matter to you.  Personal stories and constituent
  contact make a real difference.
</p>

<h2>Spread the Word</h2>
<p>
  Share this site with your neighbours, on social media, and at community
  events.  The more voices we have, the stronger our advocacy.
</p>
